{
  "name": "Schedule clients' social posts from Google Sheets with Rizamo",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Schedule clients' posts from a Google Sheet\n\nEach row with Status **Ready** becomes a scheduled post on the client's Rizamo profile. The row is then marked **Scheduled** with the post's ID.\n\n### The sheet\nColumns: **Profile ID** (prof_...), **Account IDs** (acc_..., separated by commas), **Text**, **Media URLs** (public links, separated by commas, may be empty), **Publish at** (e.g. 2026-12-01 09:00, in the profile's time zone), **Status**, **Post ID**.\n\nGet the IDs with the Rizamo node's Get Many on Profile and Account.\n\n### Setup\n1. In Rizamo, open **Developers** and create an API key.\n2. In n8n, add a **Rizamo API** credential with it.\n3. Install the node first if needed: Settings, Community Nodes, `@rizamohq/n8n-nodes-rizamo`.\n4. Pick your sheet in **Read rows** and **Mark scheduled**.",
        "width": 480,
        "height": 680
      },
      "id": "defbe122-6116-4005-96a9-ca100e7ca01f",
      "name": "About",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -560,
        -240
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "minutes",
              "minutesInterval": 15
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "3c8ebc3b-59fa-439b-bbf7-a17f2d59fa02",
      "name": "Every 15 minutes",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": ""
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": ""
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "c547be72-77fd-43b6-a12b-a110f468dad7",
      "name": "Read rows",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [
        220,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": false,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "00f20ddd-ac12-4914-851c-c6bdd29e8cb1",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.Status }}",
              "rightValue": "Ready",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "equals"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "913ff730-d823-459b-ae90-e030b2389198",
      "name": "Ready",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.filter",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        440,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "post",
        "operation": "create",
        "profileId": "={{ $json['Profile ID'] }}",
        "accountIds": "={{ String($json['Account IDs']).split(',').map(s => s.trim()).filter(Boolean) }}",
        "text": "={{ $json.Text }}",
        "when": "schedule",
        "scheduledAt": "={{ String($json['Publish at']).trim().replace(' ', 'T') }}",
        "mediaSource": "urls",
        "mediaUrls": "={{ $json['Media URLs'] || '' }}",
        "additionalFields": {}
      },
      "id": "35afe47f-b351-4e85-96ef-540c37d8c955",
      "name": "Schedule post",
      "type": "@rizamohq/n8n-nodes-rizamo.rizamo",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        660,
